189 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 125 0 R
/T (CMU-Africa instilled technical rigor while emphasizing real-world constraints. Working on vision and speech tasks highlighted the importance of careful problem formulation, dataset design, and evaluation. The environment encourages questioning generalization across new cameras, accents, domains, or limited infrastructure. It also fosters interdisciplinary collaboration, training me to bridge research with deployment-focused thinking.)
/E (CMU-Africa instilled technical rigor while emphasizing real-world constraints. Working on vision and speech tasks highlighted the importance of careful problem formulation, dataset design, and evaluation. The environment encourages questioning generalization across new cameras, accents, domains, or limited infrastructure. It also fosters interdisciplinary collaboration, training me to bridge research with deployment-focused thinking.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
