/P 137 0 R
/E (In the Fall 2025 semester, some Class of 2027 students enrolled in the Advanced Academic Skills course taught by Prof. Kwan Lee to strengthen their academic writing and develop essential research communication skills. Through the course, students built competencies in critical reading, academic writing, presentations, and research methods, including quantitative and qualitative survey design. For many, the class provided their first exposure to research, as they worked on individual projects addressing issues relevant to the CMU-Africa student community. Joel Maison is the teaching assistant for the course.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [18 19]
>>
endobj
